              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Keith Martin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great quick Holiday Dessert!",
            "datePublished": "2025-12-24T15:56:53.538Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Fiona"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe. So easy to modify to suit one’s taste. I changed it by adding a can of drained mandarin oranges and substituted whole berry cranberry sauce. Refreshing to eat anytime with a dollop of whipped crème. 😋",
            "datePublished": "2025-12-06T02:26:55.737Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kimberly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Served for thanksgiving, when it tripped childhood memories for my son. Tasted familiar yet updated for 2025. Sour cream, stirred after partially set was a flavor asset.",
            "datePublished": "2025-11-29T02:31:13.024Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Laurie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My mother made this in the 60‘s. She mixed cool whip and mayo for the topping. I make this for my family every Thanksgiving and Christmas. I add what fruit and nuts I have on hand. Always celery and their tops, whole cranberry sauce or I make it fresh. I add apples and clementines. I add pineapple if I have it. I use black cherry and raspberry jello like my mom. I don’t do the small boxes. It would not be enough for the extended family and giving some to take home.",
            "datePublished": "2025-11-28T21:13:43.443Z"
          },
          {
